  },
  {
    "id": "tables-multipage-tfoot-before-tbody",
    "category": "tables",
    "feature": "table-fragmentation",
    "subfeature": "tfoot-before-tbody",
    "description": "Same multi-page thead+tfoot table but with <tfoot> written BEFORE <tbody> in source. CSS 2.1 \u00a717 mandates section render order thead->tbody->tfoot regardless of DOM order, so Chrome paints the footer at the bottom (its reference is byte-identical to tables-multipage-tfoot-repeat). Pins the section-order reorder; the pre-fix DOM-order behavior would paint the footer band directly under the header.",
    "file": "cases/tables/tables-multipage-tfoot-before-tbody.html",
    "kind": "feature",
    "expected_support": "implemented",
    "depends_on": [
